a;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111827;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="390" width="200" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;b&gt;涉案行為&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;被告行經路口前疏未&lt;br&gt;注意車前狀況及未隨&lt;br&gt;時採取必要之安全…" style="shape=ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffff8a;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111827;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="390" width="200" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;b&gt;涉案行為&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;被害主體騎普通重型&lt;br&gt;機車在與被告同行向&lt;br&gt;之內側車道前方行…" style="shape=ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffff8a;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111827;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="390" width="200" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;b&gt;涉案行為&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;被告駕駛自用小客貨&lt;br&gt;車從後方撞及被害主&lt;br&gt;體所騎普通重型機…" style="shape=ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffff8a;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111827;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1760" y="390" width="200" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="&lt;b&gt;涉案行為&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;警方前往現場處理時&lt;br&gt;被告當場承認其為肇&lt;br&gt;事人並表示願接受…" style="shape=ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffff8a;strokeColor=#e5e7eb;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#111827;fontFamily=Microsoft JhengHei;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="2130" y="390" width="200" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="&lt;b&gt;後果評估&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;結果情形：被害主體&lt;br&gt;人車倒地；右側膝部&lt;br&gt;擦傷；左側膝部挫…" style="shap